{
  "schema": 1,
  "decision": "Elias, 25 September 2026: every jetpack in the pack pays 2.5 times its native energy per tick, the FE ones and the Mekanism hydrogen jetpack alike (docs/design/ark-modules-v2.md, Balance aparte).",
  "factor": "2.5",
  "rounding": "Integer settings round up, so no jetpack pays less than 2.5 times.",
  "provenance": "Defaults as the pinned JARs wrote them on the first start of a new QA server (NeoForge 21.1.249, 25 September 2026) and as their bytecode reads them; see the notes of each entry.",
  "ironjetpacks": {
    "jar": "IronJetpacks-1.21.1-8.0.11.jar",
    "folder": "config/ironjetpacks/jetpacks",
    "field": "usage",
    "unit": "FE/t",
    "note": "JetpackRegistry reads every *.json of the folder and writes its defaults only when the folder is missing, so the pack ships all fourteen types, equal to the defaults but usage. JetpackItem takes usage per tick of thrust (times sprintFuelMulti when sprinting); the server syncs the types to clients.",
